    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You make a character more compelling by reversing the audience's expectations. @UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.actions.Item.ttL2TstfSqOyzCd2]{Cast a Role}, selecting from between comedy, drama, irony, romance or tragedy, and @UUID[Compendium.starfinder-field-test-for-pf2e.actions.Item.o8lqmFexiwcaLpu3]{Set the Spotlight}. If the role usually gives the creature a status penalty, it instead grants a status bonus, and vice-versa. This effect lasts until you Cast a Role on that creature again.</p>",
